{"version":1,"content":"<p>隨着實時光線追蹤和路徑追蹤不斷逼近現代遊戲硬件的性能極限，研究人員正嘗試通過更聰明的算法來降低計算開銷，而不是單純依賴更強的硬件。中國武漢大學的研究團隊近日提出了一種名為BMA（Bounding-Volume Mapping Heuristic Mapping Algorithm，包圍體映射啟發式映射算法）的光線追蹤優化算法，在保持較高圖像質量的同時，最高可實現1.59倍的渲染加速，而額外內存佔用幾乎可以忽略不計。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1588248.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T16:44:29.505512+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":214,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T16:20:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T16:37:35.291844+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T16:37:35.291844+00:00","content_hash":"fac853ef5a38e157bbfba6f41a43d0204775cb8773d0d2e125bcbc2040504d24","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}